@page
@model PlanKryptoWeb.Pages.AboutModel

<section class="page">
    <h1>About &amp; Info</h1>

    <section class="section">
        <h2>About PlanKrypto</h2>
        <p>
            PlanKrypto is a crypto intelligence platform built to give traders and
            investors one place to monitor markets, manage portfolios, set smart alerts,
            and eventually access DeFi and tokenized assets in a unified experience.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-alt">
        <h2>Mission &amp; Vision</h2>
        <p>
            Our mission is to make advanced crypto tools accessible to everyone,
            not just professionals and insiders.
        </p>
        <p>
            We see a future where traditional finance and on-chain finance merge,
            and where anyone can participate in global markets with transparency and control.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <h2>How It Works</h2>
        <ul class="list">
            <li>Track prices and market movements in real time.</li>
            <li>Monitor portfolio performance and allocation.</li>
            <li>Set alerts for price levels and key moves.</li>
            <li>Use DeFi modules when they launch for staking and lending.</li>
            <li>Long term: access tokenized assets and new on-chain capital markets.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-alt">
        <h2>Security &amp; Privacy</h2>
        <ul class="list">
            <li>No unnecessary data collection.</li>
            <li>Planned read-only access for exchange connections (you keep control of funds).</li>
            <li>Encryption of sensitive data where applicable.</li>
            <li>Commitment to transparency in how data is used.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <h2>FAQ</h2>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <h3>Is PlanKrypto an exchange?</h3>
            <p>No. It is a monitoring and analytics platform. Trading will be done via connected exchanges or wallets when supported.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <h3>Is PlanKrypto non-custodial?</h3>
            <p>Yes. We do not take custody of funds; users keep control in their own wallets or exchanges.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <h3>Is DeFi available now?</h3>
            <p>Not yet. DeFi features are planned in Stage 2 of the roadmap.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
            <h3>What platforms are supported?</h3>
            <p>Web now, with iOS/Android planned or in development.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-alt">
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>Email: support@yourdomain.com</p>
        <p>
            Social:
            <a href="https://x.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">X</a> /
            <a href="https://discord.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Discord</a> /
            <a href="https://t.me" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Telegram</a>
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="terms">
        <h2>Legal</h2>
        <h3 id="privacy">Privacy Policy</h3>
        <p>Describe how user data is collected, stored, and used.</p>

        <h3>Terms of Use</h3>
        <p>Outline the terms for using the PlanKrypto platform and site.</p>

        <h3 id="risk">Risk Disclaimer</h3>
        <p>
            Crypto assets are volatile and carry risk. Nothing on PlanKrypto is financial advice.
            Users should do their own research and consult a professional before investing.
        </p>
    </section>
</section>
